   "speaker": "Mathias Cormann",
   "party": "Liberal",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2013-06-20",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Coalition supported the Parliamentary Service Amendment (Parliamentary Budget Officer) Bill 2013, which gives the Parliamentary Budget Office the additional function of auditing election costings for all parties and preparing a report within 30 days after a government is formed. The speaker argued this ensures all parties are honest in their policy commitments and that policies are fully and accurately costed."
